# What ran before a step in a loop is every call of the loop, whichever stands first (#329): a later round runs after
# every call of the one before. `main` sets the drafts up, and each round keeps its report on the shelf and then opens
# the shelf on `out`. The first round keeps it on the drafts; every later round keeps it on the shelf the round before
# opened. So `write` under `keepReport` writes the report in both folders: the drafts' set-up ran before the loop, and
# `openShelf` ran before it in the round before, although it stands after it in the body. A name the loop rebinds after
# a call holds, in the next round, what the rebinding made (#354): `keepReport` is handed both shelves, the one
# `openDrafts` made and the one `openShelf` made, and `write` under it takes the root of each. The plans of the same
# program in Python and Rust say the same (`python.plan`, `rust.plan`).

route rounds.main
step main/openDrafts
step main/openDrafts/Shelf()
step main/Shelf.keepReport
step main/Shelf.keepReport/write
step main/openShelf
step main/openShelf/Shelf()

line entry > main call
line main/openDrafts/Shelf() > Shelf@main/openDrafts/Shelf() value
line Shelf@main/openDrafts/Shelf() > main/openDrafts value
line main/openDrafts > Shelf·shelf@main/openDrafts value
line main/openShelf/Shelf() > Shelf@main/openShelf/Shelf() value
line Shelf@main/openShelf/Shelf() > main/openShelf value
line main/openShelf > Shelf·shelf@main/openShelf value
line Shelf·shelf@main/openDrafts > main/Shelf.keepReport/write value     # the first round: `write(join(this.root, ..), text)`
line Shelf·shelf@main/openShelf > main/Shelf.keepReport/write value      # every later round, on the shelf opened
line main/Shelf.keepReport/write > File(drafts/report.txt) own
line main/Shelf.keepReport/write > File(out/report.txt) own

home Shelf@main/openDrafts/Shelf() main/openDrafts
home Shelf·shelf@main/openDrafts main
home Shelf@main/openShelf/Shelf() main/openShelf
home Shelf·shelf@main/openShelf main

side entry left
side File(drafts/report.txt) right
side File(out/report.txt) right
